  "details": "In VRChat goto world:\n\nwrld_5ae795a7-f381-45f4-a45e-f1cf4b41f76f\n\nThe world loads and starts running but then immediately disconnects the user and tries to reload the world again.\n\nThis occurs 4 times and then dumps you in a timedout_v1 world.\n\nThe logs provide no clue as to what is wrong with the world to warrant the disconnection.\n\nNote I have put a spawn trap in the world to prevent it being seen before it's done. you will endlessly fall/respawn if you do manage to join the world (good luck with that).\n\nSome relevant log data:\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Entering world\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Entering Room: World Won't Load\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Joining wrld_5ae795a7-f381-45f4-a45e-f1cf4b41f76f:71700~private(usr_xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx)~nonce(6A5EC4DC26440C50588E009E036DE9B28CAD694C1C6D8454)\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Joining or Creating Room: World Won't Load\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Successfully joined room\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Spent 0.1356812s entering world.\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:12 Log        -  [Behaviour] Waiting to enter network room\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] OnLeftRoom\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] OnDisconnected: DisconnectByServerLogic\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Error      -  [Behaviour] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.photonengine.io:5058', MasterServerAddress: '91.199.81.104:5055', GameServerAddress: '91.199.81.99:5056', Code: 'DisconnectByServerLogic', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '-50249.962' }}\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] Disconnected: DisconnectByServerLogic with Reason:\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] Resetting game flow because \"DisconnectByServerLogic\": []\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] waiting for UI Manager\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] showing disconnect reason\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Error      -  [Behaviour] Lost connection to realtime network while waiting to enter room: Disconnected\n\n2023.05.21 19:39:15 Log        -  [Behaviour] Resetting game flow because \"Lost connection to realtime network while waiting to enter room\": [SkipLogin, RejoinInstance]",
